/**
 * Reassignments dispatched but not yet reflected in a state update. The drop
 * leaves the token standing in its new room, and the repaint that follows the
 * drop still reads the *old* assignment from state — without this, everyone
 * dropped somewhere new would set off walking back to where they came from
 * and turn around a moment later. Entries expire, so a rejected assignment
 * self-corrects into a walk home rather than stranding someone.
 */
